{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Voxyz_ai/status/2102531681450119426","id":"2102531681450119426","text":"holy shit, opus 5.5 is kind of insane at animation.\ni didn't write a single line of code. it wrote the story, drew every frame, and made the music. no image assets at all, it's all JS.\n\nthe story is called \"small print\": claude gets a pile of requests every day. it circles the human part hidden inside them, like \"one hand. baby's asleep\", and drops it into a jar. at night, those words turn into stars and join up into a constellation.\n\nrendered with hyperframes, all in one index.html. it synthesized the music in python, then went through the render second by second and polished it again.","raw_text":{"text":"holy shit, opus 5.5 is kind of insane at animation.\ni didn't write a single line of code. it wrote the story, drew every frame, and made the music. no image assets at all, it's all JS.\n\nthe story is called \"small print\": claude gets a pile of requests every day. it circles the human part hidden inside them, like \"one hand. baby's asleep\", and drops it into a jar. at night, those words turn into stars and join up into a constellation.\n\nrendered with hyperframes, all in one index.html. it synthesized the music in python, then went through the render second by second and polished it again.","display_text_range":[0,593],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[278,301],"id":"2102528357988515840","display":"pic.x.com/bX3Zmy4ZQx","original":"https://t.co/bX3Zmy4ZQx","replacement":"https://x.com/Voxyz_ai/status/2102531681450119426/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Voxyz_ai","url":"https://x.com/Voxyz_ai","id":"1994077573694046208","followers":21233,"following":209,"likes":4190,"media_count":505,"name":"Vox","description":"Obsessed with getting AI to do real work.\nPracticing the AI-native future before it arrives.\nBuilds, model tests, prompts to copy.","raw_description":{"text":"Obsessed with getting AI to do real work.\nPrac