 to in openclaw, and opus 4.6 was my favorite for writing.\n\nthen everything changed.\n\nuntil today. opus 5.5 is the most comfortable model i've written with since 4.6. not even fable gave me that.\nthe frontend is a lot stronger too, especially when you have it write JS animations directly. way better results.\n\nwhat do you guys think?","display_text_range":[0,416],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"Voxyz_ai","url":"https://x.com/Voxyz_ai","id":"1994077573694046208","followers":21233,"following":209,"likes":4190,"media_count":505,"name":"Vox","description":"Obsessed with getting AI to do real work.\nPracticing the AI-native future before it arrives.\nBuilds, model tests, prompts to copy.","raw_description":{"text":"Obsessed with getting AI to do real work.\nPracticing the AI-native future before it arrives.\nBuilds, model tests, prompts to copy.","facets":[]},"location":"London","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1994077573694046208/1790196505","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1998303259279138816/5bqsxKJS_200x200.jpg","joined":"Thu Nov 27 16:15:26 +0000 2025","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://www.voxyz.ai","display_url":"voxyz.ai"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":9,"retweets":3,"likes":100,"bookmarks":15,"quotes":4,"created_at":"Tue Sep 22 21:50:42 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790113842,"views":87162,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"source":"Twitter Web App","twitter_card":"tweet","color":null,"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},"source":"Twitter Web App","twitter_card":"player","color":null,"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null}}